  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Network for Education Research Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This initiative aims to build national and regional capacity in the Middle East and North Africa (MENA) for using empirical evidence in the formulation, implementation, monitoring and evaluation of education policies aimed at educational improvement. Specifically, this initiative seeks to enhance the capacity of educational research institutions, researchers and educational policy makers from MENA countries to collect, analyze, present and disseminate data on student learning and performance and to understand the factors that determine and explain differences of learning achievements, and, accordingly, formulate evidence based policies and programs to tackle student leaning and performance issues.</narrative>
  </description>
